{"v":4,"catch":"新的戰鬥序幕拉開！\n在此版本中採用兩個原創場景！","desc":"「ASSAULT PLUS」是 NAMCO（Bandai Namco Entertainment）於 1988 年發布的一款射擊遊戲。遊戲採用左右踏板獨立控制，一旦您掌握了控制方法，您就會發現它獨特的魅力。\n遊戲對其前身“ASSAULT”進行了小幅升級，提供了新的遊戲階段，同時保留了原版的樂趣！\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2025-04-03","genres":["射擊","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/106c9f80941c4ece2364a0b9f1272e2ee962b4b5d51b222b8c10b06823ee0814.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ec8584ff87758c9218a4e22753d59048b09e1d58cf97a825ab42235518aa506c.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d919932d62494c986665a96a23c402a624c51e8a7b005b6773142be4508deb0b.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/82ba7e52b85cdf2bd6e3b6e8ab5138cfa0a1742a384ed6d6f0d755bf6ee2b955.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/9ef8d20de600bb573651d9b6ef74ce5b4035ebae9013a156c1620d573eafc7e6.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/70bb2c11a304ceab0c82e036c4dad09000ae33465959ceae60e57f2e0f4c20b3.jpg"],"titleId":"0100f6d021518000","dlc":[]}